Plan
Execute
Reflect
Learn
Predict
Govern
Monitor

Capabilities:

have contracts,
are versioned,
are explainable,
use strategies.
9. Intent and Decision Layer

Intent provides purpose.

Decision provides commitment.

Relationship:

Intent

↓

Goal

↓

Decision

↓

Capability

↓

Action


Important separation:

Fact:

"What is true."

Decision:

"What we choose to do."

